Employers&apos; tools on preventing and addressing forced labour in Malaysia developed, disseminated (employer&apos;s guide, fact sheet and training facilitator&apos;s manual) and  institutionalized by the Malaysian Employers Federation
Assessment of referral systems on forced labour, trafficking and related offenses completed, and reporting and referral guide on forced labour and human trafficking jointly published  by ILO and MOHR
Enforcement manual on forced labour and human trafficking completed and co-published by the ILO and the Malaysian Anti-Trafficking in Persons and Anti-Smuggling of Migrants Council (MAPO) and institutionalized by MAPO
